      "content": "The thought of preserving a memory is a powerful, but very painful, way to cope with current feelings. Choosing to stay frozen in a past version is a way of avoiding the pain of change, but it also prevents any future happiness. While the fall feels terrifying, remember that the person you are now, the one hurting, is also capable of incredible strength. Allow yourself to feel the weight of this moment, but know that true strength lies in the messy act of choosing to keep moving forward, even when it's hard.",
